<title>PORTUGAL: Foreign investors buy PT stock.</title>
<headline>Foreign investors buy PT stock.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreign investors bought Portugal Telecom shares heavily as they absorbed stock held by employees, small investors and emigrants that was admitted to Lisbon bourse yesterday, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;National investors are on the selling side after shares of employees, small investors and emigrants were admitted to the bourse yesterday,&quot; said one operator.</p>
<p>PT shares stood at 4,300 escudos, down 20, in volume of 584,711 shares at 1300 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
